    "body": "Connected with #237 - When the setting 'Allow user to see member privacy data, e.g. Birth Year, Age.' is set to False user can see all the info under 'About Me' box. In 2.1.10\n\nI would expect the 'About Me' information to be treated as privacy data.\n\nOr maybe a tick box that allows this information to be shared under Personal Info and Contact Info on PersonEditor.php  \n\nThis is a critical issue for use due to privacy policy.\n",
